From b191802dd5408507533f17a5b51a09757bfa3080 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:17:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] glm_moe_dsa: the embedding table as column shards (D / world
 columns a rank), rows gathered and unblocked (TF_GLM_EMBED_SHARD=0: whole
 table)

Frees 1.43 GB a rank at TP4 (154,880 x 6144 bf16 / 4 x 3). A window's or prompt chunk's rows: each rank embeds its
columns into its slot of the gathered room, the slots are gathered (decode mesh / group / main communicator), and
tf_glm_unblock puts them back into rows: the same bf16 values. DSpark's and DFlash2's block passes gather through
their own route into the first norm's buffer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UQVvNktFCvQrvpNUbqtqBX
---
